Rem Optional caller-owned bank; helper itself allocates no bank.
PL_MONITOR:
Poke PL_MAILBOX+31,0
Doke PL_MAILBOX,PL_COUNT : Doke PL_MAILBOX+2,PL_EX
Doke PL_MAILBOX+4,PL_DL_ACTIVE : Doke PL_MAILBOX+6,PL_DL_LEFT
Doke PL_MAILBOX+8,PL_DL_NOW : Doke PL_MAILBOX+10,PL_DL_DURATION
Doke PL_MAILBOX+12,PL_DL_ELAPSED
Poke PL_MAILBOX+31,239
Return
